## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to implement EDF scheduling, bounded queues, per-producer fairness, backpressure, and safe shutdown under load.

## Key Concepts
- Deadline-aware scheduling (EDF)
- Bounded queues with per-producer rate limits
- Backpressure signaling and cancellation
- Graceful shutdown with in-flight tracking
- Correctness under contention and timing jitter

## Code Example
